                    STATE-CANON ANALYSIS & GAP ASSESSMENT
                     Review Date: 2026-08-27
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

OVERVIEW
────────
state-canon-mcp is a domain-agnostic "canon layer" for agents — the verified ground truth that
agents reconcile against instead of trusting their own recall. It's a standalone MCP server
(stdlib-only, no dependencies) that provides:

1. StateProvider — pluggable canonical state interface
2. Reconciler — model≡reality drift detection
3. DigestAssembler — compact onboard context
4. MCP Server — stdio JSON-RPC interface

Current version: 0.9.0 (released 2026-07-31)


