1.2 PROVIDER TYPES
────────────────────
1. JsonStateProvider — JSON document (hot-reload on mtime)
2. SqliteStateProvider — SQLite DB (read-only)
3. GitStateProvider — Git worktree drift
4. SshSqliteStateProvider — Remote SQLite over SSH

1.3 MCP TOOLS
──────────────
1. state_onboard() — full digest (~500 tok)
2. state_query(domain, filter) — narrow slice (~80 tok)
3. state_verify(domain, filter, expect) — ground truth check
4. state_reconcile() — live drift detection
5. state_journal_* — session snapshots
6. state_focus_* — per-ref focus tracking

1.4 RECONCILER TYPES
──────────────────────
1. TaskSessionReconciler — tasks domain
2. FocusTaskReconciler — focus domain
3. FreshnessReconciler — file freshness checks
4. Custom RuleCheck callables


