                           SECTION 3: GAP ANALYSIS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

3.1 CRITICAL GAPS
──────────────────

GAP-01: No Tree Execution
  state-canon has no concept of decision trees, TreeExecutor, or load_tree.
  socratic-engine has TreeExecutor that can execute .vsm/.json trees.
  
  Impact: state-canon cannot execute complex decision logic. It's passive.

GAP-02: No Predicate Registration
  state-canon doesn't have register_module(), register_predicates_dict(), or
  the flexible predicate registration system of socratic-engine.
  
  Impact: Each new predicate requires code changes, not runtime registration.

GAP-03: No Context Injection
  state-canon has no inject_context_always or the new ctx_has/doc_has_status
  API that socratic-engine v0.2.9 provides.
  
  Impact: Agents must manually inject context instead of automatic injection.

GAP-04: No Dialectical Reasoning
  state-canon has no DIALECTICAL_AND or dialectical reasoning capabilities.
  
  Impact: Complex multi-premise reasoning is limited.

GAP-05: No VSM Integration
  state-canon doesn't natively understand VSM blocks, task(), session(), or
  the VSL notation.
  
  Impact: Manual parsing required for VSM-aware operations.

3.2 MODERATE GAPS
───────────────────

GAP-06: No NATS Integration
  state-canon is stdio-only. No NATS pipeline or distributed messaging.
  
  Impact: Can't participate in real-time event streams.

GAP-07: No Policy Enforcement
  state-canon doesn't enforce binding, versioning, status, or migration rules.
  
  Impact: No automated compliance checking.

GAP-08: No Cybernetic Cycle
  state-canon doesn't auto-evaluate or apply learning back to itself.
  
  Impact: No self-improvement loop.

GAP-09: No Event Sourcing
  state-canon has journal but no full event sourcing with replay and snapshots.
  
  Impact: Limited audit trail capabilities.

GAP-10: No Security Model
  state-canon has no RBAC, auth, or encryption.
  
  Impact: No access control for multi-tenant scenarios.

3.3 MINOR GAPS
────────────────

GAP-11: No LXC Awareness
  state-canon doesn't understand Proxmox LXC containers.

GAP-12: No ML Capabilities
  state-canon has no predictive scaling or anomaly detection.

GAP-13: No Self-Healing
  state-canon doesn't automatically recover from failures.


